{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38638","headline":"鸳鸯 · 卢汝弼","name":"鸳鸯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双浮双浴傍苔矶，蓼浦兰臯绣帐帏。\n长羡鹭鸶能洁白，不随鸂鶒鬬毛衣。\n霞侵绿渚香衾暖，楼倚青云殿瓦飞。\n应笑随阳沙漠雁，洞庭烟暖又思归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢汝弼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}